notes=('Digital painting app is new: six archetypes with versions and editions from fetched pages. Vector editor 46 to 7 archetypes plus 7 flat; dropped trade (ConceptDraw PRO, Edraw Max, Corel Designer), dead (Fireworks, XD, Expression Design, DrawPlus, SaviDraw, Karbon, sK1, Sodipodi, Xfig, Aviary), embroidery (Embroidermodder; goes to the embroidery digitising shelf), diagram/animation (Dia, Synfig, Ipe, WinFIG). Desktop publishing: 5 archetypes plus 7; dropped The Print Shop (Classic shelf), LyX, Arbortext, Canva/Marq (Graphic design app). Graphic design app: Canva and Adobe Express archetypes plus 12; dropped Prezi, Animoto, Renderforest (presentation/video). Font manager 41 to 11: dropped tiny viewers and dead tools (ATM Light, MasterJuggler, Printer\'s Apprentice, Font Frenzy and similar) and the trade servers (Universal Type Server, FontAgent Server, Suitcase TeamSync). Digital painting: Photoshop brushes are not a product; Photoshop sits on the Image editor shelf.')
